to see this. please.

1341
01:19:28.002 --> 01:19:30.237
We're just going to go
for a little ride.

1342
01:19:31.405 --> 01:19:32.406
Just me and you.

1343
01:19:33.073 --> 01:19:34.542
Nice and easy like. okay?

1344
01:19:36.578 --> 01:19:38.212
-Okay.
-You don't get stupid

1345
