Hey. babe.

1349
01:19:49.223 --> 01:19:50.692
Wasn't able to find
your favorite.

1350
01:19:50.725 --> 01:19:52.359
but I did find your second--

1351
01:19:52.393 --> 01:19:53.494
Surprise.

1352
01:19:53.528 --> 01:19:55.029
- No.

1353
01:19:55.062 --> 01:19:56.196
Stop.

1354
01:20:09.443 --> 01:20:10.444
Stop it.

1355
01:20:12.146 --> 01:20:13.147
Stop.

1356
01:20:15.449 --> 01:20:17.017
No.

1357
01:21:27.789 --> 01:21:28.989
Do it.

1358
01:21:29.824 --> 01:21:31.158
Do it. goddammit.

1359
01:21:32.092 --> 01:21:33.862
The fuck are you waiting on?

1360
01:21:43.971 --> 01:21:46.073
9-1-1 what is your emergency?

1361
01:22:15.537 --> 01:22:19.106
Now we're done.

1362
01:22:23.110 --> 01:22:24.612
No. Sam. you're done.

1363
01:22:26.514 --> 01:22:27.515
<i>You're beat.</i>

1364
01:22:28.516 --> 01:22:29.950
<i>You piece of shit.</i>

1365
01:22:30.718 --> 01:22:32.252
<i>I beat you.</i>

1366
01:22:33.387 --> 01:22:34.388
It's over.

1367
01:22:35.623 --> 01:22:38.325
<i>You hear me?  It's over.</i>

1368
01:22:56.578 --> 01:22:57.579
<i>Police.</i>

1369
01:23:38.051 --> 01:23:39.888
He'll wipe that smile off
his face real quick

1370
01:23:39.921 --> 01:23:41.523
when he sees where he's going.

1371
01:23:42.824 --> 01:23:44.024
Will he?

1372
01:23:57.404 --> 01:23:58.405
Hello. hello.

1373
01:23:59.072 --> 01:24:00.107
Hey. you.

1374
01:24:00.140 --> 01:24:02.342
-Hi.
-Hi.

1375
01:24:02.376 --> 01:24:05.513
Okay. can I help with anything?
Can I help with dinner?

1376
01:24:06.781 --> 01:24:07.782
Sure.

1377
01:24:08.550 --> 01:24:09.551
Okay.

1378
01:24:11.753 --> 01:24:12.754
No.

1379
01:24:13.521 --> 01:24:14.522
I think

1380
01:24:15.455 --> 01:24:19.894
you've done enough.
so it's my time

1381
01:24:19.928 --> 01:24:22.262
to take care of you now.

1382
01:24:22.830 --> 01:24:23.831
Here you go.

1383
01:24:24.766 --> 01:24:25.767
Wow.

1384
01:24:26.701 --> 01:24:28.636
I'm certainly not going
to mess with that.

1385
01:24:28.670 --> 01:24:29.236
- Yeah.

1386
01:24:29.269 --> 01:24:30.738
- Come Here.

1387
01:24:31.806 --> 01:24:33.273
Here they are.

1388
01:24:35.442 --> 01:24:36.176
Carry on.

1389
01:24:36.209 --> 01:24:38.245
How was practice?

1390
01:24:38.580 --> 01:24:39.547
Boring.

1391
01:24:39.581 --> 01:24:40.648
Boring is good.

1392
01:24:41.181 --> 01:24:42.750
I love boring.

1393
01:24:43.317 --> 01:24:44.184
Okay.

1394
01:24:44.217 --> 01:24:46.486
One big boring family.

1395
01:24:48.056 --> 01:24:49.256
You okay with that?

1396
01:24:50.324 --> 01:24:51.726
Yes. I'm okay with that.

1397
01:24:53.061 --> 01:24:54.562
-Cheers.
-Cheers.

1398
01:24:55.563 --> 01:24:58.265
It's a one big awesome family.
come one.

1399
01:24:58.298 --> 01:24:59.567
There you go.

1400
01:25:12.647 --> 01:25:13.715
Manny?

1401
01:25:13.748 --> 01:25:15.083
Hey.

1402
01:25:15.115 --> 01:25:16.684
Just calling to check on you.

1403
01:25:17.685 --> 01:25:18.720
I'm so glad you did.

1404
01:25:20.354 --> 01:25:22.890
Let's just hope
the DA files this time.

1405
01:25:22.924 --> 01:25:23.591
huh?

1406
01:25:23.858 --> 01:25:24.859
<i>Yes.</i>

1407
01:25:25.994 --> 01:25:29.731
Listen. thank you so much
for going above

1408
01:25:29.764 --> 01:25:30.765
and beyond for me.

1409
01:25:32.232 --> 01:25:34.167
Not everyone
would have done that.

1410
01:25:35.469 --> 01:25:37.304
A long time ago.
I had this case

1411
01:25:37.337 --> 01:25:38.706
come across my desk.

1412
01:25:39.941 --> 01:25:43.811
This woman. she was married
to a pretty high-profile surgeon

1413
01:25:43.845 --> 01:25:45.046
<i>in LA.</i>

1414
01:25:45.079 --> 01:25:46.581
She was scared for her life.

1415
01:25:47.214 --> 01:25:48.616
<i>Gave the usual protocol.</i>

1416
01:25:49.282 --> 01:25:52.086
<i>She begged me.</i>

1417
01:25:52.120 --> 01:25:54.254
She simply pleaded.

1418
01:25:55.723 --> 01:26:01.194
Then she said none of the laws
would stop this guy.

1419
01:26:01.228 --> 01:26:03.531
I told her to file
a restraining order

1420
01:26:04.498 --> 01:26:06.701
<i>and that there was</i>
<i>nothing I could do.</i>

1421
01:26:06.734 --> 01:26:08.268
<i>A couple of days later.</i>
<i>I got the call</i>

1422
01:26:08.301 --> 01:26:11.471
and I showed up
and I found her husband

1423
01:26:11.506 --> 01:26:12.674
sitting on the edge of the bed.

1424
01:26:12.707 --> 01:26:16.978
He was covered in blood.
she was lying lifeless

1425
01:26:17.011 --> 01:26:18.345
<i>on the floor.</i>

1426
01:26:19.246 --> 01:26:20.447
She was long gone.

1427
01:26:22.517 --> 01:26:26.420
I should say.
I made myself a little promise

1428
01:26:26.453 --> 01:26:28.255
that I'd never break the law

1429
01:26:28.288 --> 01:26:30.992
to save someone's life.
but I would certainly maneuver

1430
01:26:31.025 --> 01:26:32.225
around it.

1431
01:26:32.927 --> 01:26:34.595
<i>Had I done that for her.</i>

1432
01:26:35.362 --> 01:26:37.464
that woman would be alive today.

1433
01:26:40.101 --> 01:26:42.335
Wow. you really are good
at telling

1434
01:26:42.369 --> 01:26:44.072
these bedtime stories.

1435
01:26:44.105 --> 01:26:45.673
Yes. it's kind of my thing.

1436
01:26:48.308 --> 01:26:49.544
I'm glad you're safe.

1437
01:26:51.378 --> 01:26:52.580
Go live your life.

1438
01:26:53.581 --> 01:26:55.415
You've earned it. Ms.Davoodi

1439
01:26:56.050 --> 01:26:57.417
So have you. Detective.

1440
01:26:59.187 --> 01:27:00.387
Take care.

1441
01:27:09.831 --> 01:27:12.033
- <i>Now. before we begin.</i>
<i>I need to know.</i>

1442
01:27:12.066 --> 01:27:17.471
<i>are you on any medications.</i>
<i>any history of mental illnesses?</i>

1443
01:27:17.972 --> 01:27:18.973
- No.

1444
01:27:20.775 --> 01:27:21.776
Then we can begin.

1445
01:27:25.146 --> 01:27:26.748
- Sit down.
-Okay.

1446
01:27:36.724 --> 01:27:37.725
Aho.

1447
01:27:38.559 --> 01:27:39.560
Aho.

1448
01:28:00.413 --> 01:28:02.583
Those lessons
make us who we are.

1449
01:28:03.518 --> 01:28:06.854
When we learn
to let go of the anger.

1450
01:28:07.688 --> 01:28:09.389
hatred. pain.

1451
01:28:10.758 --> 01:28:14.162
we realize that every person
is a reflection of what we need

1452
01:28:14.195 --> 01:28:15.263
to heal within ourselves.

1453
01:28:52.133 --> 01:28:57.171
Why do I have to feel
all their pain?

1454
01:28:57.205 --> 01:28:59.941
Why?

1455
01:29:01.075 --> 01:29:03.311
To see the pain in others

1456
01:29:03.343 --> 01:29:05.112
is to heal the pain within you.

1457
01:29:08.348 --> 01:29:09.684
I can't.

1458
01:29:11.451 --> 01:29:12.687
I need help.

1459
01:29:13.154 --> 01:29:14.322
<i>No. please.</i>

1460
01:29:14.354 --> 01:29:16.324
<i>No. please. Daddy.</i>

1461
01:29:16.356 --> 01:29:18.125
<i>No. please.</i>

1462
01:29:18.159 --> 01:29:21.428
<i>- No. please. Daddy.</i>

1463
01:29:21.461 --> 01:29:22.930
- I need help.
- <i>Stop. please.</i>

1464
01:29:30.370 --> 01:29:32.139
Let go.
I can't.

1465
01:29:33.406 --> 01:29:34.709
Send them love.

1466
01:29:37.845 --> 01:29:44.886
<i>♪ Heartbeat of our mothers. ♪</i>

1467
01:29:46.453 --> 01:29:52.727
<i>♪ See the power to forgive. ♪</i>

1468
01:29:54.629 --> 01:30:00.568
<i>♪ Fathers sky up so high. ♪</i>

1469
01:30:01.836 --> 01:30:08.109
<i>♪ Send them love</i>
<i>and let them fly. ♪</i>

1470
01:30:17.818 --> 01:30:20.154
<i>[Melody -When you</i>
<i>find compassion</i>

1471
01:30:21.088 --> 01:30:24.825
<i>for the brokenness of others.</i>

1472
01:30:26.027 --> 01:30:28.062
you can truly forgive them.

1473
01:30:29.096 --> 01:30:33.534
Then they no longer have
any power over you.

1474
01:30:35.036 --> 01:30:36.503
It's so hard.

1475
01:30:36.537 --> 01:30:40.041
The world has thrown
everything it could at you.

1476
01:30:42.043 --> 01:30:44.578
From when you were a child

1477
01:30:44.612 --> 01:30:49.016
with a war in Iran.
to your journey to America

1478
01:30:49.650 --> 01:30:51.085
for a better life

1479
01:30:51.886 --> 01:30:53.821
all on your own.

1480
01:30:56.190 --> 01:30:58.960
You have endured so much.

1481
01:30:59.827 --> 01:31:02.462
You're no stranger to pain.

1482
01:31:04.198 --> 01:31:07.068
You have suffered betrayal

1483
01:31:07.101 --> 01:31:09.904
at the hands of the man you wed.

1484
01:31:12.006 --> 01:31:14.909
and through all of that.

1485
01:31:15.509 --> 01:31:17.211
you still stand

1486
01:31:18.112 --> 01:31:19.780
for what is right.

1487
01:31:21.215 --> 01:31:27.955
You stand for compassion.
empathy towards others.

1488
01:31:27.989 --> 01:31:32.760
So much so you've made it
your life's mission.

1489
01:31:35.096 --> 01:31:38.466
Rise above any pain

1490
01:31:38.498 --> 01:31:42.403
and imagine yourself

1491
01:31:42.436 --> 01:31:44.205
still smiling.

1492
01:31:45.039 --> 01:31:47.675
That is true power.

1493
01:31:52.646 --> 01:31:53.914
How do you feel?

1494
01:31:56.984 --> 01:31:57.985
Free.

1495
01:32:06.527 --> 01:32:09.830
The women's freedom movement
in Iran

1496
01:32:10.664 --> 01:32:13.768
is an ongoing struggle

1497
01:32:13.801 --> 01:32:17.738
for gender equality
and civil rights

1498
01:32:17.772 --> 01:32:20.908
for over four decades now.

1499
01:32:20.941 --> 01:32:25.346
Women are victims
to discrimination laws related

1500
01:32:25.379 --> 01:32:27.615
to divorce.

1501
01:32:27.648 --> 01:32:30.718
child custody. and inheritance.

1502
01:32:31.520 --> 01:32:32.887
Women

1503
01:32:32.920 --> 01:32:37.992
die for their right to protest
in our quest for justice.

1504
01:32:38.893 --> 01:32:41.862
but what happened
to my daughter here.

1505
01:32:42.663 --> 01:32:44.665
this kind of abuse

1506
01:32:45.599 --> 01:32:48.202
is not limited to Iran alone.

1507
01:32:48.235 --> 01:32:51.739
Sadly. it is happening
all over the world.

1508
01:32:52.840 --> 01:32:55.776
Maybe to the people we see
every day.

1509
01:32:55.810 --> 01:32:58.779
They may even be our friends.

1510
01:32:58.813 --> 01:33:03.317
My beloved daughter is here
to talk about her journey.

1511
01:33:14.061 --> 01:33:16.197
Thank you all so much
for being here.

1512
01:33:17.164 --> 01:33:21.669
Unfortunately. there is
no satisfying conclusion

1513
01:33:21.702 --> 01:33:26.073
to my story with my ex-husband.

1514
01:33:26.107 --> 01:33:31.445
If he had sought help
for his childhood traumas

1515
01:33:31.479 --> 01:33:34.715
or his battle with alcoholism.

1516
01:33:34.748 --> 01:33:37.718
perhaps we could have saved
our family.

1517
01:33:37.751 --> 01:33:41.956
but instead. it led him down
a very dark path.

1518
01:33:42.990 --> 01:33:46.127
Despite his attempts
to have me harmed

1519
01:33:46.561 --> 01:33:48.329
or even killed.

1520
01:33:48.362 --> 01:33:51.966
he was released from prison
after just a few days.

1521
01:33:51.999 --> 01:33:54.869
Now for almost three years.

1522
01:33:54.902 --> 01:33:59.306
he's been living freely while
my children and I remain

1523
01:33:59.340 --> 01:34:00.741
in constant fear.

1524
01:34:01.543 --> 01:34:03.310
Through my spiritual journey.

1525
01:34:04.712 --> 01:34:06.947
I found a way to embrace

1526
01:34:06.981 --> 01:34:07.815
my trauma.

1527
01:34:07.848 --> 01:34:10.651
It has been a source of rebirth.

1528
01:34:11.218 --> 01:34:12.720
allowing me to forgive.

1529
01:34:13.254 --> 01:34:14.188
to heal.

1530
01:34:14.221 --> 01:34:16.891
and most importantly.
to reclaim my power.

1531
01:34:17.458 --> 01:34:19.894
Today. I am at peace.

1532
01:34:19.927 --> 01:34:21.695
and I am happy again.

1533
01:34:21.729 --> 01:34:24.798
and I would love
to share that light

1534
01:34:25.666 --> 01:34:27.868
to heal and inspire others.

1535
01:34:29.036 --> 01:34:30.371
My charity.

1536
01:34:30.404 --> 01:34:31.839
Still Smiling.

1537
01:34:31.872 --> 01:34:33.674
is dedicated to this mission.

1538
01:34:34.509 --> 01:34:37.311
We are committed
to building safe havens

1539
01:34:37.344 --> 01:34:40.247
for survivors of abuse
and domestic violence

1540
01:34:40.281 --> 01:34:41.282
across the globe.

1541
01:34:41.882 --> 01:34:43.217
but that is not enough.

1542
01:34:44.118 --> 01:34:45.119
We must do more.

1543
01:34:46.220 --> 01:34:48.856
We have to stand for those.
and especially for those

1544
01:34:48.889 --> 01:34:50.224
who don't have a voice.

1545
01:34:50.891 --> 01:34:52.793
We need to stay united

1546
01:34:52.826 --> 01:34:55.429
because together
we can create a better.

1547
01:34:55.462 --> 01:34:58.032
a safer world for all of us.

1548
01:34:59.466 --> 01:35:00.467
Thank you.
